st genuinely  doesn't understand  Tanisha's ID and watch can be found in  the Flatiron District in an underground  car park she had put quite some distance  between herself and the dark zone and it  almost left the area completely in her  last known location there were no  hostiles anywhere near her  but for any number of reasons much like  a lot of the other agents that escaped  the dark zone she decided to remove her  watch an ID and leave the area of all of  the agents that we've looked at so far  there is very little to go on from here  she just vanished there are a series of  ropes that followed the path she was  taking that lead directly into a large  group of wreckers including one of the  Rocky lieutenants she could have got  mixed up with them but other than that  this area is relatively peaceful and  abundant with supplies it's possible  that she's long gone from the area but  at the same time she could still be  hanging around watching over these  streets  Regan Murphy comes from a law  enforcement family her father  grandfather and three siblings all work  for police departments understandably  her family was very supportive of a  decision to follow her father into  Worcester Police Department  Regan has been wounded twice in the line  of duty  both times preventing harm from coming  to civilians she was decorated for both  incidents Regan was recruited into the  US Marshal Service after three years on  the force and has served with  distinction on occasion she seems eager  to throw herself into harm's way  who willingness to sacrifice for the job  is admirable but on occasion takes it  too far she has been written up once for  lack of attention to self care and her  superiors have spoken of difficulty  finding marshals to partner with her due  to a tendency to take risks  Regan's watch an ID can be found just  outside of the dark zone in the Kips Bay  district loyal and not one to run from a  challenge  she has simply fallen back to regroup  it's likely